606
00:54:45,407 --> 00:54:48,702
Yo era una oveja descarriada

607
00:54:49,828 --> 00:54:52,623
-¡Canten, malditos!
-Yo no amaba el rebaño

608
00:54:52,664 --> 00:54:54,082
